  "description": "Maximum cassotto depth on the Bayan — the internal resonance chamber darkening every note to near-oblivion. Buzz threshold low so even quiet playing activates the chien. Drone strings tuned in dissonant intervals: a minor second below, a tritone below. The instrument that has been in the dark too long and learned to prefer it.",
